{"id":776,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Eating sulfur in its volcanic habitat is what causes explosive compounds to develop in its shell. Its droppings are also dangerously explosive."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Explosive substances coat the shell on its back. Enemies that dare attack it will be blown away by an immense detonation."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Its exploding shell poses a real danger but is sensitive to moisture. On rainy days, Turtonator takes silent refuge in caves."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It lives in volcanoes and eats sulfur and other minerals. Materials from the food it eats form the basis of its explosive shell."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"It gushes fire and poisonous gases from its nostrils. Its dung is an explosive substance and can be put to various uses."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"The shell on its back is chemically unstable and explodes violently if struck. The hole in its stomach is its weak point."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Shell Armor","hidden":false,"description":"A hard shell protects the Pokémon from critical hits."}],"eggGroups":["Monster","Dragon"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":null,"color":"Red","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":776,"name":"Turtonator","condition":null,"children":[]},"moves":{"game":"Sword / Shield","level":[[1,33],[1,123],[4,52],[8,182],[12,203],[16,175],[20,510],[24,334],[28,406],[32,34],[36,53],[40,704],[44,504],[48,315],[52,153]],"machine":[213,776,34,693,339,523,337,406,89,203,263,126,83,53,430,374,411,416,535,257,484,63,304,334,442,231,25,5,200,315,371,182,156,279,317,496,214,173,76,707,444,164,241,269,253,474,261,526],"egg":[174,457,229,469],"tutor":[807,434,808,799,815]},"cards":[{"id":"sv7-146","name":"Turtonator","set":"Stellar Crown","date":"2024-09-13","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"146","artist":null,"img":"sv7/146"},{"id":"me3-17","name":"Turtonator","set":"Perfect Order","date":"2026-03-27","rarity":"Uncommon","numb